  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 2103540039680
    m_Localized: <style="Blue">Boomerang</style>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 2305462222848
    m_Localized: Immediately return to your hand after playing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 2503508869120
    m_Localized: <style="Blue">Clone</style>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 2596051992576
    m_Localized: Create a copy of this card and shuffle it into the Discard Pile
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 3445264334848
    m_Localized: <smallcaps><style="Blue">Overload</style></smallcaps>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 3569226989568
    m_Localized: Play this card as many times as the number of cards played this
      round
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 3958399680512
    m_Localized: <smallcaps><style="Blue">Exhaust</style></smallcaps>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 4067308978176
    m_Localized: Remove from the deck until the end of Battle after playing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 5756648800256
    m_Localized: <style="Blue">Marked</style>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 5860579459072
    m_Localized: Drawn in the first Round of the Battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 5978716225536
    m_Localized: <style="Blue">Stay</style>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 6061062995968
    m_Localized: Stays in your hand after the end of Round
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 6165513748480
    m_Localized: <style="Blue">Quick</style>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 6298116669440
    m_Localized: If not drawn at the beginning of the Round, it costs 0 Energy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 6405587320832
    m_Localized: <style="Blue">Yoyo</style>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 6498130444288
    m_Localized: After playing, shuffle this card back into the Draw Pile instead
      of the Discard Pile
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 34068222202462208
    m_Localized: <style="Blue">Durability</style>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 34068222215045120
    m_Localized: Reduce Durability by 1 every time this card is played. Upon reaching
      0, this card is being destroyed until the end of Battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654799
  - m_Id: 55826930826842112
    m_Localized: <smallcaps><style="Blue">Grow</style></smallcaps>
